{"availability":"available","full":"Mehedihasan444/mehedi-hasan-portfolio","name":"mehedi-hasan-portfolio","description":"Full-stack developer portfolio — Next.js 16 + React 19 frontend, Express + Prisma/PostgreSQL API, deployed on Vercel. Animated sections, blog, projects, and a token-gated admin CMS.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-21T16:47:10Z","updated":"2026-10-04T19:07:24Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mehedi-hasan-portfolio-client.vercel.app/","topics":["express","gsap","nextjs","pnpm","portfolio","postgresql","prisma","react","tailwindcss","threejs","turborepo","typescript","vercel","web-performance"],"demo":"https://mehedi-hasan-portfolio-client.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:20.016Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:20.016Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:20.016Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:19.803Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:21:20.016Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Three.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production-grade developer portfolio and content platform — an animated Next.js 16 front end powered by a self-hosted Express + Prisma CMS.","This repository contains my personal portfolio website along with the custom CMS that powers it. The public site is server-rendered, ISR-cached, and built around motion and WebGL — while every piece of its content (projects, blog posts, skills, experience, testimonials, site settings) is managed through a token-gated admin panel instead of hardcoded files.","It is deliberately built as a production system rather than a static page: two independently deployed Vercel applications, a typed PostgreSQL schema with migrations and seeding, a hardened Express middleware chain, and CI-grade quality gates (zero-warning ESLint, strict TypeScript, conventional commits). Heavy animations are progressively disabled for touch devices, reduced-motion users, and low-end hardware, and long-running animation loops pause when the tab is hidden."],"features":["12 animated sections — hero, about, skills, experience, projects, education, certifications, achievements, GitHub activity, testimonials, blog preview, and contact.","Project showcase — filterable listing with rich detail pages, image galleries with lightbox, and markdown case studies.","Blog — post listing and reading pages served from the CMS.","Live GitHub activity — contribution heatmap and repository language breakdown.","Contact form — validated client-side and persisted server-side with spam/DoS protection."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mehedihasan444/mehedi-hasan-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"04208bbb6f84a85542e7dd4754b97235ebbdb635e1564c84eabb4261df785c76","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:20.163Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:20.163Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A production-grade developer portfolio and content platform — an animated Next.js 16 front end powered by a self-hosted Express + Prisma CMS.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mehedihasan444/mehedi-hasan-portfolio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Token-gated login (JWT in httpOnly cookies) with a dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mehedihasan444/mehedi-hasan-portfolio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"04208bbb6f84a85542e7dd4754b97235ebbdb635e1564c84eabb4261df785c76","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mehedihasan444/mehedi-hasan-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:20.163Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T19:07:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mehedihasan444/mehedi-hasan-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:20.164Z","hash":"04208bbb6f84a85542e7dd4754b97235ebbdb635e1564c84eabb4261df785c76","originalBytes":11544,"storedBytes":11544,"truncated":false,"s